---
import "./work.css";
import { homeContactHrefFromPagePath } from "../../../lib/leadSource";
import { CTA_PRIMARY_CONTACT } from "../../../site/cta";

const PROJECT_URL = "https://sewingataga.co.uk";
const pagePath = Astro.url.pathname.replace(/\/+$/, "") || "/";
const homeContactHref = homeContactHrefFromPagePath(pagePath);
---

<article class="cs-page section" aria-labelledby="cs-title">
  <div class="container">
    <nav class="cs-back" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <ol class="cs-back__list">
        <li>
          <a href="/work/">Product Lab</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="cs-back__sep" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
          <span class="cs-back__here">Sewing Ataga</span>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <!-- ─── 1. HEADER ─────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <header class="cs-header">
      <div class="cs-header__eyebrow">
        <span class="k-kicker k-kicker--md">Case study</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="cs-title" id="cs-title">Sewing Ataga</h1>
      <p class="cs-client-line">Tailoring &amp; Alterations &mdash; London, UK</p>

      <div class="cs-tags" aria-label="Project scope">
        <span class="cs-tag">2025</span>
        <span class="cs-tag">Client project</span>
        <span class="cs-tag">Web design</span>
        <span class="cs-tag">Development</span>
        <span class="cs-tag">Local SEO</span>
        <a
          class="cs-tag cs-tag--url"
          href={PROJECT_URL}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer noopener"
          aria-label="Visit Sewing Ataga live website"
        >
          sewingataga.co.uk <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="cs-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <!-- ─── 2. INTRO + SCOPE ──────────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="cs-intro">
      <div class="cs-intro__body">
        <p>
          Sewing Ataga is a London-based tailoring and alterations studio. The business had built
          a loyal local clientele through word of mouth and referrals &mdash; but lacked a web
          presence that matched the quality of their craft.
        </p>
        <p>
          We designed and developed their website from scratch: clear service pages, a
          mobile-first layout structured around customer intent, and a solid local SEO
          foundation &mdash; delivered fast, without unnecessary complexity.
        </p>
      </div>

      <aside class="cs-scope" aria-label="Project scope of work">
        <h2 class="cs-scope__heading">Scope of work</h2>
        <ul class="cs-scope__list" role="list">
          <li>Web design (UI / UX)</li>
          <li>Web development</li>
          <li>Mobile-first layout</li>
          <li>Service page architecture</li>
          <li>Local SEO foundations</li>
          <li>Contact flow optimisation</li>
          <li>Performance optimisation</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <!-- ─── 3. THE CHALLENGE ──────────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="cs-challenge">
      <span class="cs-section-label" aria-hidden="true">The challenge</span>
      <blockquote class="cs-challenge__pull">
        <p>
          When someone searches for a local tailor, the website is the first handshake.
          Without it, even a brilliant business loses the room before the conversation starts.
        </p>
      </blockquote>
      <p class="cs-challenge__body">
        Sewing Ataga had built genuine trust with existing customers, but had no professional
        web presence to support new customer discovery. With no site to land on, potential
        customers had only social media to judge credibility &mdash; an inherent gap in a market
        where presentation signals quality.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- ─── 4. BROWSER PREVIEW ───────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="cs-preview-wrap">
      <figure class="cs-browser" aria-label="Sewing Ataga website preview">
        <div class="cs-browser__bar" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="cs-browser__dots">
            <span class="cs-dot cs-dot--red"></span>
            <span class="cs-dot cs-dot--yellow"></span>
            <span class="cs-dot cs-dot--green"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="cs-browser__address">sewingataga.co.uk</div>
          <div class="cs-browser__spacer"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="cs-browser__viewport">
          <img
            class="cs-browser__img"
            src="/screenshots/sewing-ataga-desktop.jpg"
            alt="Sewing Ataga — homepage on desktop, showing service pages and contact CTA"
            width="1200"
            height="760"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />

          <div class="cs-browser__fallback" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="cs-browser__fallback-inner">
              <span class="cs-browser__fallback-url">sewingataga.co.uk</span>
              <span class="cs-browser__fallback-hint">Tailoring &amp; Alterations &mdash; London</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="cs-browser__shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>

          <a
            class="cs-browser__live"
            href={PROJECT_URL}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer noopener"
            aria-label="Open Sewing Ataga live website in new tab"
          >
            View live site <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <figcaption class="cs-browser__caption">
          Sewing Ataga &mdash; homepage, desktop view
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <!-- ─── 5. WHAT WAS BUILT ─────────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="cs-built">
      <header class="cs-built__header">
        <span class="cs-section-label">What was built</span>
        <h2 class="cs-built__title">
          Designed for discovery.<br />Built for trust.
        </h2>
      </header>

      <div class="cs-built__grid">
        <div class="cs-built__card">
          <h3>Service-led structure</h3>
          <p>
            Pages organised around how customers actually search &mdash; not internal business
            labels. Clear, easy to scan on a phone, and logical from first visit to enquiry.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="cs-built__card">
          <h3>Mobile-first layout</h3>
          <p>
            Most local service searches happen on a phone. The layout was designed for mobile
            from the first wireframe &mdash; not an afterthought adaptation of a desktop design.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="cs-built__card">
          <h3>Frictionless contact flow</h3>
          <p>
            Every page routes naturally toward getting in touch. No unnecessary friction,
            no form barriers &mdash; just a clear path from customer intent to enquiry.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="cs-built__card">
          <h3>Local SEO foundations</h3>
          <p>
            Structured metadata, location-intent content, clean URL structure, and basic
            schema markup &mdash; the technical base for local visibility done properly from day one.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="cs-built__card">
          <h3>Brand-aligned visual system</h3>
          <p>
            Clean, warm, professional &mdash; a visual language that reflects the quality of the
            craft, without overdesigning or losing the approachable feel of a local business.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="cs-built__card">
          <h3>Performance-first build</h3>
          <p>
            Fast load times, optimised assets, lean code &mdash; a performance-led build aimed
            at strong real-world speed and stable, maintainable delivery.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ─── 6. OUTCOMES ──────────────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="cs-outcomes">
      <span class="cs-section-label">Outcomes</span>
      <h2 class="cs-outcomes__title">A site that holds its own.</h2>

      <ul class="cs-outcomes__list" role="list">
        <li class="cs-outcome">
          <span class="cs-outcome__num" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
          <p>
            Professional online presence that reflects the quality of the work &mdash;
            the gap between reputation and visibility, closed.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="cs-outcome">
          <span class="cs-outcome__num" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
          <p>
            Clear, structured service pages that answer what new customers need to know
            before making contact &mdash; without overwhelming them.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="cs-outcome">
          <span class="cs-outcome__num" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
          <p>
            Mobile-first design ready for the reality of how local customers find and
            evaluate businesses in 2025.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="cs-outcome">
          <span class="cs-outcome__num" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
          <p>
            Solid local SEO foundations &mdash; technically positioned to earn visibility
            in local search from launch, not after a costly rebuild.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- ─── 7. INLINE CTA ────────────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="cs-cta" role="region" aria-label="Start a project with Kersivo">
      <div class="cs-cta__inner">
        <p class="cs-cta__pre">Ready to start?</p>
        <h2 class="cs-cta__title">
          Your business deserves a site that works as hard as you do.
        </h2>
        <p class="cs-cta__body">
          We work with a small number of UK businesses at a time. If your site no longer
          reflects the quality of your work, get in touch &mdash; we will give you a straight
          answer on fit, scope, and what it would take.
        </p>
        <div class="cs-cta__actions">
          <a
            href={homeContactHref}
            class="k-btn k-btn--primary k-btn--magnetic"
            data-magnetic="true"
            data-cta="contact"
          >
            <span class="k-btn__label">{CTA_PRIMARY_CONTACT}</span>
            <span class="k-btn__shine" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="k-btn__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/packages/" class="k-btn k-btn--ghost">
            <span class="k-btn__label">See packages</span>
            <span class="k-btn__arrow2" aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
